cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, dataset, or MBSE architectural models, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Edge Telemetry Layer: An Open-Source Embedded Real-Time Telemetry and Hardware-in-the-Loop Architecture for CAN and OBD-II with Formal MBSE Verification"
abstract: "A low-cost, open-source embedded edge telemetry architecture for automotive CAN and OBD-II diagnostics, implemented in asynchronous no_std Rust (ESP32-S3 / Embassy) and C++ (Arduino HIL ECU emulator), with full-lifecycle Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE) formal verification across NASA FRET, AADL (OSATE), and CAvA variability/evolution."
authors:
